flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser editor] --> Pages[Cloudflare Pages static Next.js]
  Browser <-->|WebSocket / IndexedDB| API[Cloudflare Worker API]
  API --> D1[(D1 metadata / RBAC / audit)]
  API --> KV[(KV tickets / flags)]
  API --> DO[DocumentRoom Durable Object]
  DO --> SQLite[(DO SQLite: updates + latest snapshot)]
  DO --> Q[Cloudflare Queue]
  Q --> Consumer[Queue consumer / same Worker]
  Consumer --> D1
  Consumer -. optional binding .-> Neon[(Neon analytics via Hyperdrive)]
  API -. structured logs .-> Obs[Workers Observability]
  API -. optional DSN .-> Sentry[Sentry]
